@startuml er-security
' Nene - ER diagram (part 2 of 3): authenticator binding, security management,
' proof reservations and transaction confirmations.
' Source of truth: migrations 20261103000100, 000500, 000600, 000700, 000800,
' 20261107000100 (later ALTERs of CHECK constraints already applied below).
' Notation: IE (crow's foot). "*" = NOT NULL.

title Cơ sở dữ liệu Nene (2/3) - bảo mật giao dịch (gắn TOTP, bằng chứng mã, xác nhận)

hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #286E78
  ArrowColor #333333
}

entity "user_profiles" as user_profiles #EEF5F6 {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  (see er-core)
}

entity "authenticator_setup" as authenticator_setup {
  * customer_id : uuid <<PK>> <<FK>>
  --
  * request_id : uuid <<UQ>>
  * session_id : uuid (Auth session)
  factor_id : uuid (Supabase MFA factor, no FK)
  * state : text {starting|pending|verifying|
    ready|blocked|restricted}
  * revision : integer = 1
  * attempts : integer (0..5)
  * expires_at : timestamptz (now + 10 min)
  * created_at : timestamptz
  * security_not_before : timestamptz = 'epoch'
}

entity "security_management" as security_management {
  * id : uuid <<PK>>
  --
  * customer_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * session_id : uuid
  * revision : integer
  * purpose : text {replace|recover|codes}
  * step : text (13 states, see note)
  * old_factor_id : uuid
  new_factor_id : uuid
  * lease_id : uuid
  * attempts : integer (0..5)
  * expires_at : timestamptz (now + 10 min)
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity "security_proof_reservations" as security_proof_reservations {
  * customer_id : uuid <<PK>> <<FK>>
  * factor_scope : text <<PK>>
  * fingerprint : text <<PK>> (HMAC of code)
  --
  * purpose : text
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

entity "security_proof_key" as security_proof_key #F8F7F2 {
  * id : boolean <<PK>> (single row)
  --
  * secret : text (backend-only HMAC key)
}

entity "transaction_confirmations" as transaction_confirmations {
  * id : uuid <<PK>> (= signed review id)
  --
  * customer_id : uuid <<FK>>
  * session_id : uuid
  * review_digest : text (HMAC of review token)
  * factor_id : uuid
  * security_revision : integer
  * state : text {checking|factor_confirmed|rejected|
    unknown|cancelled|posted}
  * purpose : text {preview|local_transfer|local_deposit|
    local_withdrawal|local_interbank} = 'preview'
  * expires_at : timestamptz (review + 10 min)
  * lease_until : timestamptz (now + 30 s)
  confirmed_until : timestamptz (<= 2 min)
  * created_at : timestamptz
}

user_profiles ||--o| authenticator_setup : customer_id
user_profiles ||--o{ security_management : customer_id
user_profiles ||--o{ security_proof_reservations : customer_id
user_profiles ||--o{ transaction_confirmations : customer_id

authenticator_setup ||..o{ transaction_confirmations : "factor_id, revision must match\nfactor_id, security_revision\n(checked in code, no FK)"
authenticator_setup ||..o{ security_management : "old_factor_id copied from\nfactor_id (no FK)"
security_proof_key ..> security_proof_reservations : "keys fingerprint"
security_proof_key ..> transaction_confirmations : "keys review_digest"

note right of security_management
  Giá trị step: proof, proving, authorized, enrolling,
  pending, verifying, verified, issuing, codes_shown,
  finishing, cancelling, completed, cancelled.
  Partial unique index one_security_management: mỗi
  khách hàng tối đa một dòng chưa completed/cancelled.
end note

note bottom of security_proof_reservations
  Dùng chung cho thiết lập, quản lý authenticator và mọi
  xác nhận: mỗi dấu vân tay mã chỉ giữ chỗ được một lần
  (chống phát lại); tối đa 10 lần / khách hàng / 15 phút
  (dòng cũ hơn bị xoá).
end note

note bottom of transaction_confirmations
  Chỉ là siêu dữ liệu bảo mật - không số tài khoản, số tiền hay token.
  Chi tiết giao dịch nằm trong review token ký HMAC phía client.
  Với mục đích khác preview, hàm ghi sổ khoá dòng này, yêu cầu
  factor_confirmed và đặt state = 'posted'; id dòng trở thành
  id biên lai (xem phần 3/3).
end note

@enduml
